msgid "Start preparing"
msgstr "用意を始める"


msgid "Startup check complete."
msgstr "起動時の確認ができました。"


msgid ""
"Printing maps and directions\n"
"requires a printer which supports\n"
"double sided printing"
msgstr ""
"地図と道順を印刷するには、両面印刷に\n"
"対応したプリンターが必要です。"


msgid ""
"Choose up to 7 contacts to print\n"
"on your Paper Phone"
msgstr "印刷する連絡先を7件まで選択できます。"


msgid ""
"Choose the calendars you want\n"
"to print to your Paper Phone"
msgstr ""
"Paper Phoneに印刷したいカレンダーを\n"
"選択します。"


msgid ""
"Choose the task lists you want\n"
"to print to your Paper Phone"
msgstr "Paper Phoneに印刷したいタスクリストを選択します。"


msgid ""
"An empty space will be added to your\n"
"Paper Phone to capture\n"
"thoughts and ideas"
msgstr ""
"あなたのPaper Phoneに\n"
"空きスペースが追加され、考えや\n"
"アイデアを記録することができます。"


msgid ""
"Add a screenshot or\n"
"picture to your Paper Phone"
msgstr ""
"スクリーンショットまたは写真を\n"
"Paper Phoneに追加します"


msgid ""
"Cut marks will be added to\n"
"your Paper Phone for you\n"
"to store a contactless card"
msgstr ""
"Paper Phoneにカットマークが\n"
"追加されます。"


msgid ""
"Choose a Paper App to print\n"
"to your Paper Phone"
msgstr ""
"Paper Appを選んで\n"
"Paper Phoneに追加します。"


msgid ""
"Print maps and directions onto\n"
"the back of your Paper Phone"
msgstr "地図と道順を印刷します。"


msgid ""
"Tap to select the things you want\n"
"to print to your Paper Phone"
msgstr ""
"タップして、Paper Phoneに印刷\n"
"したいものを選択します。"


msgid ""
"To fold your phone, lay the page map\n"
"side up and fold it in half so the two\n"
"\n"
"little circles at the bottom of the page\n"
"touch\n"
"\n"
"Then fold in half again so the squares\n"
"are touching\n"
"\n"
"Then fold\n"
"in half one last time\n"
"\n"
"If you would like to keep a contactless card\n"
"inside your Paper Phone then please carefully\n"
"cut along the dotted diagonal lines."
msgstr ""
"折り方は、ページマップを上にして、\n"
"ページ下部の2つの丸が触れるように\n"
"半分に折り、四角が触れるように\n"
"もう一度半分に折ってから、\n"
"最後にもう一度半分に折ってください。"


msgid ""
"Please choose the Google\n"
"account you wish to use"
msgstr ""
"使用するGoogleアカウントを\n"
"選択してください。"


msgid ""
"This experiment prints a\n"
"little paper phone with the\n"
"most important information\n"
"you'll need for the day"
msgstr ""
"この実験では、あなたの一日で\n"
"一番大事なことを、\n"
"小さな紙の電話に印刷します。"


msgid ""
"Just choose the information\n"
"you would like to include on\n"
"your Paper Phone and\n"
"\n"
"hit print"
msgstr ""
"Paper Phoneに載せたい情報を\n"
"選んで、printを押すだけ。"


msgid ""
"A printable Paper Phone which\n"
"helps you take a break away\n"
"from your digital world"
msgstr ""
"デジタルの世界から離れて\n"
"一息つくのに役立つ、\n"
"印刷可能なPaper Phone。"


msgid ""
"%s\n"
"\n"
"You can do this in the settings.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to do this now?"
msgstr ""
"%s\n"
"\n"
"これは設定からできます。\n"
"\n"
"今すぐやりますか？"
